<title>UK: Merrill Lynch adds 200 mln Sfr to 2-tranche bond.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch adds 200 mln Sfr to 2-tranche bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following two-tranche bond has been increased to a total of 700 million Swiss francs from a total of 500 million Swiss francs, lead manager Merrill Lynch Capital Markets AG said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MERRILL LYNCH AND CO INC</p>
<p>TRANCHE ONE</p>
<p> AMT  **300 MLN CHF   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    14.AUG.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     FLAT	PAY DATE    14.MAY.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA3/AA-   ISS PRICE  100.04    FULL FEES   =</p>
<p> NOTES    **INCREASED FROM 200 MLN SFR</p>
<p>TRANCHE TWO</p>
<p> AMT  **400 MLN CHF   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    15.FEB.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +7 BP     PAY DATE    14.MAY.97</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA3/AA-   ISS PRICE  100.12    FULL FEES   =</p>
<p> NOTES    **INCREASED FROM 300 MLN SFR</p>
<p>+ + + + +</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> LISTING    EBS	 DENOMS (K) 10</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
